## 1. Introduction

Welcome to Rivika, a silver jewellery catalogue application developed and maintained by RTD CREATIVES.

We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy describes how information is collected, used, stored, protected, and deleted when you use the Rivika Android application.

## 2. Information We Collect

Depending on the features you use, we may collect the following information:

**Account Information**
- Email address used for authentication
- Username or display name, if provided
- Unique account identifier generated by Firebase Authentication
- Additional profile information voluntarily submitted by users

**Application Information**
- Jewellery products saved to your wishlist
- User preferences and account settings
- Information necessary to maintain your account and provide catalogue features

**Technical Information**

Our application and integrated service providers may process technical information such as device identifiers, app version, operating system information, and diagnostic information to support functionality, security, and reliability.

Any analytics or crash-reporting data collection depends on the services enabled in the application.

## 3. How We Use Information

We use information to:

- Authenticate users and manage accounts
- Display jewellery collections and product information
- Maintain wishlists and saved preferences
- Provide updated silver rate information
- Respond to support enquiries
- Maintain application security and reliability
- Diagnose technical problems and improve the application

We do not sell users' personal information.

## 4. Third-Party Services

Rivika uses Google Firebase services to support authentication, database storage, and application functionality.

These services may process information on our behalf in accordance with their applicable privacy and security policies.

Google Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy

Firebase Privacy Information: https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy

Additional third-party services, where enabled, will be disclosed as applicable.

## 5. Data Storage and Security

We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect user information.

These measures include encrypted communication, authentication mechanisms, and database access controls.

Although we take appropriate precautions, no electronic storage or transmission system can guarantee absolute security.

## 6. Data Sharing

We may disclose information to service providers that process data on our behalf for authentication, hosting, storage, security, and application operations.

We may also disclose information when legally required or necessary to protect users and the security of our services.

We do not sell personal information to advertisers or data brokers.

## 7. Data Retention

Account information, saved preferences, and wishlist data may be retained while an account remains active or as necessary to provide the application services.

When an account is deleted, associated personal information and account-linked data will be deleted, except for information that must be retained for legitimate legal, security, or regulatory purposes.

Any retained information will be limited to the applicable purpose and retention period.

## 8. Account and Data Deletion

Users may request deletion of their Rivika account and associated personal information.

To request deletion, contact:

**rivikajewels@gmail.com**

Email subject: **Delete Account**

Please contact us using your registered email address so that we can verify account ownership.

Following verification, we will process the request and remove associated account data within the applicable deletion timeframe.

Users may also access the account deletion process through the deletion option or deletion resource provided within the application.

## 9. Children's Privacy

Rivika is a general jewellery catalogue application and is not specifically directed toward children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware of such collection without appropriate authorisation, we will take steps to delete the information.

## 10. Your Privacy Rights

Subject to applicable laws, users may request:

- Access to their personal information
- Correction of inaccurate information
- Deletion of their account and associated data
- Information about how their personal data is processed

Requests can be submitted to rivikajewels@gmail.com.

